      "text": "Aye Eye is building a privacy-first edge-AI camera platform: local AI, live video, device intelligence, and the app &#x2F; developer tools around it.<p>We’re hiring for 3 roles Remote (UK&#x2F;EU preferred):<p>1) Senior Product Designer\nOwn UX&#x2F;UI for the Aye Eye &#x2F; Trojan app platform. Mobile&#x2F;tablet journeys, wireframes, Figma design system, and clickable prototypes. First mission includes onboarding, dashboard, live view, alerts, device setup, AI query, shop, subscription, and settings.<p>2) Developer Platform Lead\nDefine the self-serve developer ecosystem: portal structure, onboarding flows, documentation, sandbox model, and submission workflows.<p>3) Senior Full Stack Developer\nBuild the portal behind that ecosystem: auth, dashboards, API keys, sandbox access, submission workflows, and licensing touchpoints.<p>We want people who can simplify complex systems, work fast, and ship clean, commercially usable product experiences.<p>Email: ayeeye.careers@gmail.com\nSubject: HN – [Role Name]"
