      "text": "Kai | Engineering (Multiple) | Onsite (San Jose, CA) | Full-time<p>Ai + Cybersecurity. Our Ai team is well funded, and growing. Although we have a dedicated engineering team, the Ai team is looking for dedicated engineers to work closely with the applied Ai scientist to build the platform and pipelines.<p>Principal Software Engineer, AI Platform:\n<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ats.rippling.com&#x2F;kai-cyber-inc&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;a6d62968-4831-42cb-a4c9-888dbb947070\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ats.rippling.com&#x2F;kai-cyber-inc&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;a6d62968-4831-42...</a><p>Senior Software Engineer, AI Platform:\n<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ats.rippling.com&#x2F;kai-cyber-inc&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;d567048a-7b1b-4e5d-a17f-630aa987bbf6\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ats.rippling.com&#x2F;kai-cyber-inc&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;d567048a-7b1b-4e...</a><p>We are also looking for a few more applied Ai scientists as well as many other roles. I invite you to take a look:<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.kai.security&#x2F;careers#open\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.kai.security&#x2F;careers#open</a>"
