      "text": "Electric Twin | London, UK | Hybrid (3&#x2F;4 days per week in office)\nElectric Twin builds simulations of real customer audiences, so teams can test decisions before shipping them. We just raised $14 million and are growing rapidly.<p>We’re a small, team backed by top investors and operators, working with real clients on real problems. We’re hiring engineers (and other roles) who want high ownership, meaningful impact, and to help shape both the product and the company as we grow.<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.lever.co&#x2F;electric-twin\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.lever.co&#x2F;electric-twin</a><p>Feel free to reach out directly if you&#x27;d like to know more: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.linkedin.com&#x2F;in&#x2F;smithharryh&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.linkedin.com&#x2F;in&#x2F;smithharryh&#x2F;</a>"
