      "id": 47623753,
      "by": "nossyah",
      "text": "Post Up | Full time | Senior Backend Engineer | Onsite | Vancouver, BC (Hybrid) | Salary: $120-$130k CAD | \n<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.postup.pro\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.postup.pro</a><p>We&#x27;re building the Databricks for content production, starting with post. Our orchestration engine coordinates pipelines end to end and turns post-production workflows into a persistent graph of assets and transformations, which are deterministic, verifiable, and nearly instant at scale, powered by a high-performance compute layer. We&#x27;re building this AI-native from the ground up; ML inference is embedded throughout the pipeline, not bolted on.<p>Stack: On-prem, HPC clusters, distributed storage systems, GPU pipelines, real-time video compute.<p>We&#x27;re looking for our founding senior backend engineer who wants to work on genuinely challenging infrastructure problems across distributed systems and media processing with immense scale. Should be familiar with Golang, Postgres, Distributed systems, Distributed filesystems (e.g. HDFS, Ceph, etc). If that sounds interesting, reach out directly to me at wilson@postup.pro.<p>Me: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.linkedin.com&#x2F;in&#x2F;hayswilson&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.linkedin.com&#x2F;in&#x2F;hayswilson&#x2F;</a><p>How to apply: Email me directly at wilson@postup.pro or Submit here - <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.notion.so&#x2F;Founding-Senior-Backend-Engineer-31031c9ae3e680218d5fc42a3b2f6777\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.notion.so&#x2F;Founding-Senior-Backend-Engineer-31031...</a>"
