      "text": "Espresso AI | Staff ML &amp; Staff Infra Engineers | Brooklyn or San Francisco | Full time<p>We&#x27;re using LLMs to build neural optimizers, neural scheduling systems, and neural workload tuners. (If you&#x27;re ex-Google, you can think of it like Borg powered by LLMs.)<p>Today we use ML to make data warehouses and spark jobs more efficient. We&#x27;re hiring staff ML engineers to train models that can understand how much compute a job needs, how it scales to larger machines, whether a machine can run more jobs, and so on; and staff infra engineers to take those models and deploy them on real-world production systems.<p>If this sounds cool, please email me: ben [at] espresso [dot] ai"
