      "id": 47611720,
      "by": "alexvboe",
      "text": "Cogram (YC W22, <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cogram.com\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cogram.com</a>) | Multiple Roles | Remote or hybrid (US&#x2F;EU&#x2F;UK) | Full-time<p>Cogram builds AI agents for architects and engineers. Our tools automate project management and streamline CAD&#x2F;BIM workflows for leading firms around the world. We have engaged customers using our products day-to-day on real projects and are growing fast.<p>We&#x27;re hiring across GTM and engineering:<p><pre><code>  · Growth &#x2F; GTM engineers and early-stage marketers: technically strong and excellent writers.\n\n  · Account Executives: based in US East&#x2F;Central or UK. At least two years of exceeding targets in software sales.\n\n  · Builders and former founders: strong at talking to users, understanding requirements, and shipping features end-to-end.\n</code></pre>\nSee all roles:\n<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.ycombinator.com&#x2F;companies&#x2F;cogram&#x2F;jobs\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.ycombinator.com&#x2F;companies&#x2F;cogram&#x2F;jobs</a><p>We offer:<p><pre><code>  · Work directly with customers using our tools daily on architecture, engineering, and construction projects.\n\n  · Build differentiated products with real traction at the intersection of software, the physical world, and design.\n\n  · A deeply focused, high-caliber team.\n</code></pre>\nIf you’re applying for a GTM role (GTM Engineer or AE), email alex - at - cogram - dot - com with subject:\nCogram GTM Application 0326<p>We’d love to hear from you."
