      "id": 47626144,
      "by": "IanWoodfill",
      "text": "Hey all, Cassidy (<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cassidyai.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cassidyai.com</a>, Series A, ONSITE: New York City) is growing fast and we&#x27;re hiring across a few critical roles in NYC.<p>Senior &amp; Mid-level Software Engineers - end-to-end product engineering and helping build systems that scale<p>Technical Chief of Staff - CTO&#x27;s operational right hand. Picks up hard, ambiguous problems across engineering, compliance, and commercial conversations and owns them end to end.<p>Cassidy is an AI agent and automation platform for non-technical knowledge workers. By connecting to a company&#x27;s knowledge where it lives and building intuitive core primitives, Cassidy lets non-technical teams automate large swaths of busy work, freeing them up to do the work that really matters. Series A, 25 people, growing fast."
