      "id": 47633062,
      "by": "fatimaausman8",
      "text": "Subject: Full Stack Engineer Application - Fatima Usman<p>Location: Remote (PKT)<p>Hi,<p>I’m reaching out regarding your recent post in the HN &quot;Who is Hiring&quot; thread. \nStack: React, TypeScript, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Express.js.<p>What I&#x27;ve shipped:<p>AI-powered fashion platform (PERN + OpenCV) — Team lead; earned 2nd place at a national competition for a clean, modern UI and complex data processing.<p>Full-stack music app (React + Node.js + REST API) — Developed during my time at Red Buffer.<p>15+ Figma-to-React component builds — Expert at translating high-fidelity designs into pixel-perfect, responsive components at PixelSoft Solutions.<p>Happy to share my GitHub, CV, or jump on a 15-minute call to discuss how I can help scale your platform.<p>Best,<p>Fatima Usman\nfatimaausman8@gmail.com"
