      "by": "ukd1",
      "text": "9 Mothers YC P26 | Robotics &#x2F; Software Engineering | Austin, ONSITE | $150-400k + equity + benefits | 9mothers.com<p>I&#x27;m Russ, one of the founders of 9 Mothers. We&#x27;re making AI weapon systems out of Austin, TX. Our first product is for stopping group 1 suicide drones. We started in 2025 - still a small team under 20 people. We&#x27;re hiring for a lot of roles, but mostly in software and robotics.<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;9-mothers\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;9-mothers</a>"
