      "id": 47605713,
      "by": "Findeton",
      "text": "Sequent Tech | Senior Fullstack Engineer | REMOTE (Global) | Full-time | sequentech.io<p>Sequent builds cryptographically secure online voting infrastructure used in 200+ real elections across multiple countries. We&#x27;re a fully remote team working on an open-source platform combining Rust, TypeScript, and modern DevOps. We handle End-to-end encrypted voting, cryptographic mixnets, and tamper-evident logging.<p>Tech Stack: Rust, TypeScript&#x2F;React, WebAssembly, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Kubernetes, Keycloak, ImmuDB<p>Open Roles:<p>Senior Fullstack Engineer (Rust + TypeScript&#x2F;React)"
