      "id": 47636489,
      "by": "w3mason",
      "text": "(AU ONLY &#x2F; REMOTE)<p>Senior engineer to step into a ~30k LOC system (~300 files) and help shape it properly.<p>Production-style system with real complexity. Interdependent modules, async flows, external integrations.<p>Stack: Python&#x2F;FastAPI backend, Next.js frontend, early-stage routing&#x2F;AI components.<p>Expectations:<p>- quickly understand an existing codebase<p>- trace data flow across modules&#x2F;services<p>- identify structural issues and bottlenecks<p>- make pragmatic improvements without overengineering<p>Starts with a deep dive and direction, with room to stay involved and build it out.<p>AU-based only (R&amp;D constraints).<p>Email: mattahbla+hn@gmail.com"
