      "id": 47603243,
      "by": "tiffsaw",
      "text": "Fold | Remote (US Only) | Senior Back End Engineer | Full-time<p>Fold is a publicly listed bitcoin financial services company building the tools people need to earn, buy, sell and live on Bitcoin. We&#x27;re looking for a Senior BE Engineer to help build the financial infrastructure behind our products - payment processing, ledger systems, card transaction flows and event-driven pipelines.<p><pre><code>  - 5+ years software engineering experience\n  - Strong in: Java or similar (Kotlin, Scala, C#)\n  - Experience with: production microservices, distributed systems\n  - Familiar with: messaging&#x2F;event streaming (Kafka, Pulsar)\n  - Solid relational database and data modeling skills\n  - Nice-to-have: fintech, payments, ledger&#x2F;accounting domains\n  - Nice-to-have: event-driven architectures, CQRS, event sourcing\n  - Nice-to-have: Micronaut, Quarkus or similar modern Java frameworks\n  - US residency (regulatory requirement)\n</code></pre>\nBenefits:\n  - Competitive salary + equity\n  - 401k with 3% match\n  - Unlimited PTO + yearly vacation stipend\n  - Full health&#x2F;dental&#x2F;vision\n  - Paid parental leave\n  - Regular team meetups\n  - Bitcoin starter pack (hw wallet included)<p>Email tiffany.sawhney (a) foldapp.com if you have questions or apply here: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ats.rippling.com&#x2F;fold-inc&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;514ba20e-a93e-4960-ad5d-9e7c2e7c5776\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ats.rippling.com&#x2F;fold-inc&#x2F;jobs&#x2F;514ba20e-a93e-4960-ad...</a> [0] <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;foldapp.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;foldapp.com</a>"
