      "id": 47606584,
      "by": "nongraphical",
      "text": "Fractional AI | Staff&#x2F;Principal Software Engineer | SF, NY, NC, Dubai | Onsite<p>We’re a team of experienced generalist SWEs and AI enthusiasts who are building custom AI agents for enterprise clients. No AI experience required: we are actively trying to be the best place in the world to learn applied AI.<p>I’m Frank, an engineer here. This is the first services-style company I’ve worked at, so for those of you in a similar boat, this is what I’ve really liked so far:<p>* The learning rate is super fast. 3-4 client projects a year, each with different tech stacks, products, industries, and architectures. Lots of learning resources including a full AI engineering bootcamp when you onboard.<p>* Our projects are typically high priority and sponsored by prominent executives. The path here for projects to have real impact on usage or bottom line is much shorter.<p>* We’re “selling pickaxes during the gold rush”. When AI finds its next killer app, we’ll be the first to know about it.<p>We’re hiring staff+ SWEs onsite with offices in San Francisco, New York, Durham NC, and Dubai. Feel free to reach out to me directly (frank@fractional.ai) or take a look at the full job posting:<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;fractional-ai&#x2F;1db16198-e91e-425d-83a4-3551ca674e46\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;fractional-ai&#x2F;1db16198-e91e-425d-83...</a>"
