      "id": 47616392,
      "by": "l2labs",
      "text": "Founding (AI&#x2F;Software) Engineer + Founding Research Scientist | NYC | <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.l2labs.ai&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.l2labs.ai&#x2F;</a><p>L2 Labs is a brand new applied AI lab advancing database systems, data mapping, and data integration. We&#x27;re fast growing: we closed a pre-seed funding round, established partnerships with Cornell and NYU, and secured a large enterprise customer in less than 3 months. We are a team of hard-working researchers and engineers who are obsessive about intricate, greenfield data problems - we love whiteboarding, spinning up experiments, ordering pizza, and suddenly it’s 2am and we&#x27;ve actually solved something. We build impactful products + publish in A* research venues.<p>We are currently seeking Founding Research Scientists + SWEs, with very meaningful upside in the form of a generous equity package. To learn more&#x2F;reach out, email hiring@l2labs.ai."
