      "id": 47603280,
      "by": "mrsbeep",
      "text": "RemoteWorks.pro | Head of Marketing &#x2F; CMO | Remote | Equity Only<p>I&#x27;m the solo founder&#x2F;developer of RemoteWorks.pro — a portfolio SaaS for remote professionals. You publish your portfolio on personal subdomain (username.remoteworks.pro) in minutes, with 12 templates, Pro feature gating, a full analytics system, and a built-in SEO content engine (26 blog posts, competitor comparison pages, structured data).<p>The technical foundation is complete. What&#x27;s missing is someone who can turn it into a business.<p>What you&#x27;d own:\n- Growth strategy (SEO leverage, community, content, partnerships)\n- Acquisition channels — we have comparison pages vs Carrd, Read.cv, Polywork, Contra, etc. ready to rank\n- Positioning and messaging for the remote work audience\n- Early user relationships and conversion to Pro ($12&#x2F;mo or $99&#x2F;yr)<p>Who I&#x27;m looking for:\nSomeone who has grown an early-stage SaaS or developer tool before. You understand PLG, know how to build in public, and have opinions about which channels to prioritize before paying for anything.<p>The structure steps up as you prove the role: 10% in year one, 20% from year two, 30% from year two and a half onward. No cliff, no salary — this is a co-founder-level commitment on the GTM side.<p>Email me directly(me@remoteworks.pro) or reply here."
