      "id": 47607508,
      "by": "allennikka7",
      "text": "Cenva Labs | Senior SWE &#x2F; Technical Lead | Remote (US, West Coast&#x2F;Central hours) | $130K-$150K<p>Healthcare-focused engineering firm in LA. We build and maintain the technical infrastructure for a concierge primary care practice serving employer groups across multiple states.<p>Looking for a player-coach: hands-on in TypeScript&#x2F;Node.js + React + AWS (Lambda, ECS, RDS, SST, PostgreSQL) every day, while mentoring a junior engineer and owning architecture decisions. Healthcare integrations are messy (EHR systems, labs, SFTP file drops, claims data) - if you&#x27;ve done this kind of work, you know.<p>Healthcare&#x2F;HIPAA experience strongly preferred. This is a path to running the technical operation, not a staff augmentation gig. Small team, real ownership, no bureaucracy.<p>Paid take-home assessment (no LeetCode). We compensate you for your time regardless of outcome.<p>Health&#x2F;dental&#x2F;vision (50% covered), 401(k), unlimited PTO.<p>Apply at: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.cenvalabs.com&#x2F;careers&#x2F;senior-software-engineer-technical-lead\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.cenvalabs.com&#x2F;careers&#x2F;senior-software-engineer-t...</a>"
