      "text": "Redbook Software | Staff Software Engineer | REMOTE (U.S.) | $200k-$250k<p>Redbook is the new software of reference for cattle feed yards. We&#x27;re digitizing the $90B cattle industry, the largest in agriculture. We have built the only cloud-based product in the industry that connects field operations and financials.<p>Upcoming projects include integration with other #agtech software, tooling to streamline customer onboarding, integrations with hardware, integration with futures market, and much more!<p>We are a senior team of 5 people, we value autonomy, keep meetings low, and we&#x27;re fully remote. Our engineers backgrounds include Stack Overflow, Microsoft, Atlassian, Elastic, and ngrok.<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;app.dover.com&#x2F;apply&#x2F;redbook-software&#x2F;fa6c1d33-5de6-4156-8bfc-8a4c04d58c7f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;app.dover.com&#x2F;apply&#x2F;redbook-software&#x2F;fa6c1d33-5de6-4...</a>"
