      "text": "WorkWhile | Senior &amp; Staff Engineers (Backend, Full Stack) | San Francisco, New York, Seattle, Toronto | Hybrid | Full Time<p>I&#x27;m an EM at WorkWhile. We&#x27;re an ML-powered labor marketplace on a mission to help 80M+ hourly workers find better-paying, more predictable work. Our platform uses demand forecasting, realtime skill based worker shift matching, dynamic pricing and many other features to solve problems in a $650B staffing industry that still runs on spreadsheets, phone calls and legacy systems.<p>Demand for our services is increasing and we have a lot planned. We&#x27;re growing and hiring across the product engineering org at senior and staff levels:<p>* Senior Software Engineer, Full Stack<p>* Senior Software Engineer, Backend<p>* Staff Software Engineer, Full Stack<p>* Staff Software Engineer, Backend<p>We are a small engineering team with a lot of surface area, real ownership and impact. See link below for more details about the company and the roles.<p>Apply here: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;workwhilejobs?departmentId=065f00c2-5d4c-44b4-8197-69b6ac7e7d53&amp;utm_source=kYzppAMMBZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;jobs.ashbyhq.com&#x2F;workwhilejobs?departmentId=065f00c2...</a><p>Let me know if you have any questions (email in profile)."
