      "text": "My Signal Well (Austin, TX) | Founding Engineer | ONSITE Austin | Fractional or full-time<p>AI health coaching, personalized, data-driven, built on real biomarkers (DNA, wearables, labs, food logs). Product is live. Stack: Python&#x2F;FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Fitbit + Apple Health integrations, LLM pipelines. Infrastructure needs modernization — no containers yet. That&#x27;s where you come in.<p>What makes this different: we run an autonomous AI engineering team (Claude Code agents) that handles feature builds and deploys. You&#x27;re not writing CRUD. You own architecture, infrastructure, and the path to scale.<p>First priority: containerize, CI&#x2F;CD, HIPAA-compliant AWS migration.<p>Must have: Python, Docker in production, PostgreSQL, ops mindset. Health tech or regulated industry experience is a plus. You&#x27;ve built and scaled something real.<p>shane@mysignalwell.com"
