      "text": "GenTube | Founding Engineer | Toronto (preferred) | Full-time<p>We&#x27;re turning a billion consumers into creators. AI creation as entertainment.<p>Early signals:<p>- ~10M creations&#x2F;month\n- Daily usage, people come back to build on each other<p>You’ll own:<p>- Core loop (create → remix → repeat)\n- Real time generation (latency, cost, scale)\n- Feed + ranking (what gets seen, what gets built on)<p>What we want:<p>- Strong full-stack engineer\n- You’ve run real systems (latency, scale, reliability)\n- High ownership \n- Default to speed in 0→1 environments<p>Why this:<p>- 50M+ remixes — real behavior, not a demo\n- Small team, high slope.. engineer #3–4\n- Defining a new category: creation as entertainment<p>Comp: $100–150k + meaningful equity<p>Email: mo [at] gentube [dot] app"
