      "text": "Lago (YC S21) | Europe+USA | Remote or Hybrid | Full-time |<p>The AI-Native, Open-source, usage-based billing platform. Lago is now trusted by CoreWeave, Synthesia, Groq, PayPal and Mistral AI to manage their billing. YC &amp; FirstMark backed.<p>Open Roles Include:<p>- Account Executive (Remote USA)<p>- Product Engineer (Growth&#x2F;Building AI Agents)(Europe or USA)<p>- Product Engineer (Core product)<p>- Infrastructure Engineer (Remote Europe, Canada or Brazil)<p>Lago Website: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;getlago.com&#x2F;hiring\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;getlago.com&#x2F;hiring</a>\nYC Jobs Page: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.ycombinator.com&#x2F;companies&#x2F;lago\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.ycombinator.com&#x2F;companies&#x2F;lago</a><p>Looking forward to seeing some great applications!"
