      "id": 47604057,
      "by": "Natashkaaa_fox",
      "text": "Company: Karma8\nLocation: Remote (Moscow timezone, UTC+3)\nType: Full-time\nCompensation: from $2500&#x2F;month<p>Russian-speaking team<p>Karma8 builds S3-compatible object storage for high-throughput workloads (AI, video, large-scale systems).<p>Tech stack:\nVanilla JavaScript, jQuery, Bootstrap, HTML&#x2F;CSS, Git<p>What you’ll do:\n– Build and optimize high-load interfaces\n– Work on dashboards, UI components, internal tools\n– Improve existing codebase (no rewrites)<p>Requirements:\n– Strong JS&#x2F;CSS&#x2F;HTML fundamentals\n– Experience with jQuery, Bootstrap, Git\n– Performance mindset, cross-browser, HTTP basics\n– Experience with high-load or large-scale systems<p>We intentionally use vanilla JS (no frameworks).<p>Contact:\nTelegram: @teamchat_hr<p><a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;career.habr.com&#x2F;vacancies&#x2F;1000164014\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;career.habr.com&#x2F;vacancies&#x2F;1000164014</a>"
