      "by": "dowakin",
      "text": "9 Mothers Defense | Robotics Engineers | Austin TX | Full-time | ONSITE<p>We&#x27;re a YC company building AI-driven turrets to stop hostile drones - where robotics needs F1-level speed.<p>We&#x27;re looking for smart, T-shaped teammates: experts in some part of robotics who are happy to jump in wherever needed.<p>U.S. persons only.<p>Contact CTO directly at roman@9mothers.com with your portfolio of previously built robots"
